# Probe output is generated, not committed. The probes here write into `results/` on every
# run; those files are working material that git history already preserves, and committing
# them made a multi-megabyte artifact out of numbers any reader can regenerate in minutes.
#
# A result that becomes a genuinely frozen input or oracle is the explicit exception: add it
# with `git add -f`, and say in the retaining document why it is frozen. The default is
# ephemeral.
results/
